/****** UP-Cycle.mcc/UPA_Cycle_Active ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Cycle_Active -- attribute of UP-Cycle.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       LONG: index of the shown entry (notifies)
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Cycle_Active - access ISG. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Cycle.mcc
*
******/

/****** UP-Cycle.mcc/UPA_Cycle_Entries ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Cycle_Entries -- attribute of UP-Cycle.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       Char**: NULL terminated, must outlive the object
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Cycle_Entries - access I. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Cycle.mcc
*
******/
